  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "상처약에 대해\n들어 보셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1CC98C57DC5D00020B300D574000AB4E4C5B40020BCF4C168B098C694003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상처약에 대해 들어 보셨나요?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n싸움으로 상처 입은 포켓몬에게\n사용해 주세요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1CC98C57DC5D00020B300D5740020B4E4C5B40020BCF4C168B098C694003F00100001BE01000AC2F8C6C0C73CB85C0020C0C1CC980020C785C7400020D3ECCF13BAACC5D0AC8C000AC0ACC6A9D5740020C8FCC138C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상처약을 사용하면\n포켓몬센터에 가지 않아도<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n포켓몬을 건강하게 만들 수 있어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1CC98C57DC7440020C0ACC6A9D558BA74000AD3ECCF13BAACC13CD130C5D00020AC00C9C00020C54AC544B3C400100001BE00000AD3ECCF13BAACC7440020AC74AC15D558AC8C0020B9CCB4E40020C2180020C788C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0003>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하나 어떠신가요?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558B0980020C5B4B5A0C2E0AC00C694003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르갈레트를 하나\n서비스로 드리겠습니다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974AC08B808D2B8B97C0020D558B098000AC11CBE44C2A4B85C0020B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르갈레트는 1인당 하나씩만\n서비스로 드리고 있습니다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974AC08B808D2B8B29400200031C778B2F90020D558B098C529B9CC000AC11CBE44C2A4B85C0020B4DCB9ACACE00020C788C2B5B2C8B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "몬스터볼은\n충분히 준비했니?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAACC2A4D130BCFCC740000ACDA9BD84D7880020C900BE44D588B2C8003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "와일드 존에 들어갈 거라면\n몬스터볼을 준비해 두는 게 좋아.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C640C77CB4DC0020C874C5D00020B4E4C5B4AC080020AC70B77CBA74000ABAACC2A4D130BCFCC7440020C900BE44D5740020B450B2940020AC8C0020C88BC544002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0002>ZL로 잘 조준한 다음\n몬스터볼을 던져 봐!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0A0002005A004CB85C0020C7980020C870C900D55C0020B2E4C74C000ABAACC2A4D130BCFCC7440020B358C8380020BD1000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이동 스폿!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B3D90020C2A4D3FF002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "방문한 적 없는 포켓몬센터를 발견하면\n들렀다 가는 걸 추천해!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>이동 스폿<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>으로 맵에 등록되거든.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이런 멋진 정보를 잘 기억할 수 있게\n순발력깃털을 나눠 줄게!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르를 많이 돌아다닐수록\n여기저기 다니기 편해질 거야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974B97C0020B9CEC7740020B3CCC544B2E4B2D0C218B85D000AC5ECAE30C800AE300020B2E4B2C8AE300020D3B8D574C9C80020AC70C57C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모미지 리서치!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8BBF8C9C00020B9ACC11CCE58002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "3번 와일드 존에 있는\n모든 종류의 야생 포켓몬을 잡았더니<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n모미지 리서치 보상을 받았어!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n기분이 좋으니까 남은 볼을 나눠 줄게.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모미지 리서치를 열심히 하면\n좋은 일이 많이 있을 거야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8BBF8C9C00020B9ACC11CCE58B97C0020C5F4C2ECD7880020D558BA74000AC88BC7400020C77CC7740020B9CEC7740020C788C7440020AC70C57C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "홀로베이터!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D640B85CBCA0C774D130002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "원리는 잘 모르겠지만 홀로베이터를 타면\n최신 기술을 통해 위아래로 워프할 수 있어!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n너무나도 놀라운 나머지\n너에게 좋은 걸 주고 싶어지네!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "홀로베이터를 발견하면\n꼭 이용해 봐!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D640B85CBCA0C774D130B97C0020BC1CACACD558BA74000AAF2D0020C774C6A9D5740020BD1000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "두 번째로\n중요한 것은 머니...<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4500020BC88C9F8B85C000AC911C694D55C0020AC83C7400020BA38B2C8002E002E002E00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르 여기저기에는\n반짝반짝 빛나는 것이 떨어져 있으니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n모아서 팔면 금세 부자가 될 수 있어!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n자! 내가 모아 둔\n작은버섯을 줄 테니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n포켓몬센터에 팔아 봐.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "반짝반짝 빛나는 건 다시 생겨나기도 해.\n참 신기하지?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC18C9DDBC18C9DD0020BE5BB098B2940020AC740020B2E4C2DC0020C0DDACA8B098AE30B3C40020D574002E000ACC380020C2E0AE30D558C9C0003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋은 걸 드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC7400020AC780020B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "크레이프는 다 팔아서 없지만\n대신 좋은 걸 드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n자! 선제공격손톱이에요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D06CB808C774D504B2940020B2E40020D314C544C11C0020C5C6C9C0B9CC000AB300C2E00020C88BC7400020AC780020B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002100100001BE00000AC79000210020C120C81CACF5ACA9C190D1B1C774C5D0C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "선제공격손톱을 지닌 포켓몬은\n기술을 빠르게 사용할 때가 있어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C120C81CACF5ACA9C190D1B1C7440020C9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC740000AAE30C220C7440020BE60B974AC8C0020C0ACC6A9D5600020B54CAC000020C788C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파사주!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CC0ACC8FC002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고운깃털을 판 돈으로\n고운 아이템을 사는 건 어때?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0C6B4AE43D138C7440020D3100020B3C8C73CB85C000AACE0C6B40020C544C774D15CC7440020C0ACB2940020AC740020C5B4B54C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "옷을 갈아입고 싶다면\n메인 메뉴를 열고<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0005>Minus를 누르면 돼!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C637C7440020AC08C544C785ACE00020C2F6B2E4BA74000ABA54C7780020BA54B274B97C0020C5F4ACE000100001BE00000A00100002BD0A0005004D0069006E00750073B97C0020B204B974BA740020B3FC00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "경험사탕!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACBDD5D8C0ACD0D5002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "경험사탕에 대해 들어 보셨나요?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n포켓몬에게 경험사탕을 주면\n어째선지 경험치가 늘어나더군요!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n나눠 드릴 테니 직접 확인해 보세요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "경험치가 늘어나는 경험사탕...\n어른의 맛인 걸까요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 3348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACBDD5D8CE58AC000020B298C5B4B098B2940020ACBDD5D8C0ACD0D5002E002E002E000AC5B4B978C7580020B9DBC7780020AC78AE4CC694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 3408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기술머신!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 3420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C220BA38C2E0002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "구멍이 있다면 숨고 싶다...\n그렇지만 숨을 구멍이 보이지 않는다...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그럴 땐 직접 파는 수밖에 없어!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD6CBA4DC7740020C788B2E4BA740020C228ACE00020C2F6B2E4002E002E002E000AADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020C228C7440020AD6CBA4DC7740020BCF4C774C9C00020C54AB294B2E4002E002E002E00100001BE00000AADF8B7F40020B5500020C9C1C8110020D30CB2940020C218BC16C5D00020C5C6C5B400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "구멍파기 기술은 땅속으로 파고들어\n모습을 숨겼다가 상대를 공격할 수 있지!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n숨은 동안에는 누구도 볼 수 없고 말이야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD6CBA4DD30CAE300020AE30C220C7400020B545C18DC73CB85C0020D30CACE0B4E4C5B4000ABAA8C2B5C7440020C228ACBCB2E4AC000020C0C1B300B97C0020ACF5ACA9D5600020C2180020C788C9C0002100100001BE00000AC228C7400020B3D9C548C5D0B2940020B204AD6CB3C40020BCFC0020C2180020C5C6ACE00020B9D0C774C57C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "산책 힌트!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0B0CC450020D78CD2B8002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "산책 힌트를 보며 즐기는 산책!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이럴 땐 수분 보충도 중요해.\n자, 내가 가진 물을 나눠 줄게!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0B0CC450020D78CD2B8B97C0020BCF4BA700020C990AE30B2940020C0B0CC45002100100001BE01000AC774B7F40020B5500020C218BD840020BCF4CDA9B3C40020C911C694D574002E000AC790002C0020B0B4AC000020AC00C9C40020BB3CC7440020B098B2200020C904AC8C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "산책 힌트를 보려면\n메인 메뉴에서 <U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0001>L을 누르면 돼.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0B0CC450020D78CD2B8B97C0020BCF4B824BA74000ABA54C7780020BA54B274C5D0C11C002000100002BD0A0001004CC7440020B204B974BA740020B3FC002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿/",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "택시!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0DDC2DC002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "택시를 타면 아직 가 본 적 없는\n장소에도 갈 수 있어!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n다시 말해, 이동 스폿을 늘릴 수 있다는 거야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0DDC2DCB97C0020D0C0BA740020C544C9C10020AC000020BCF80020C8010020C5C6B294000AC7A5C18CC5D0B3C40020AC080020C2180020C788C5B4002100100001BE00000AB2E4C2DC0020B9D0D574002C0020C774B3D90020C2A4D3FFC7440020B298B9B40020C2180020C788B2E4B2940020AC70C57C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기사님의 잡담이\n정말 별로일 때도 있지만 말이야...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 4136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C0ACB2D8C7580020C7A1B2F4C774000AC815B9D00020BCC4B85CC77C0020B54CB3C40020C788C9C0B9CC0020B9D0C774C57C002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 4196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "신기한 나무열매!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 4208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2E0AE30D55C0020B098BB34C5F4B9E4002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매는 정말 신기하단 말이지!\n저마다 다양한 효과를 가지고 있잖아.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n너도 하나 써 보지 않을래?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 4256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4B2940020C815B9D00020C2E0AE30D558B2E80020B9D0C774C9C00021000AC800B9C8B2E40020B2E4C591D55C0020D6A8ACFCB97C0020AC00C9C0ACE00020C788C796C544002E00100001BE00000AB108B3C40020D558B0980020C3680020BCF4C9C00020C54AC744B798003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매의 설명을 잘 확인하고\n알맞게 사용해 봐!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 4376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4C7580020C124BA85C7440020C7980020D655C778D558ACE0000AC54CB9DEAC8C0020C0ACC6A9D5740020BD1000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿7",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 4432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 기술머신을!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 4444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020AE30C220BA38C2E0C744002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미래를 예지해 보겠어요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n저는 지금부터 당신에게\n기술머신을 드릴 거예요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 4492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B798B97C0020C608C9C0D5740020BCF4ACA0C5B4C694002100100001BE01000AC800B2940020C9C0AE08BD80D1300020B2F9C2E0C5D0AC8C000AAE30C220BA38C2E0C7440020B4DCB9B40020AC70C608C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미래예지 기술을 사용하면\n얼마 후에 상대가 있던 위치로<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n염동력 덩어리를 보내 공격할 수 있어요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 4580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B798C608C9C00020AE30C220C7440020C0ACC6A9D558BA74000AC5BCB9C80020D6C4C5D00020C0C1B300AC000020C788B3580020C704CE58B85C00100001BE00000AC5FCB3D9B8250020B369C5B4B9ACB97C0020BCF4B0B40020ACF5ACA9D5600020C2180020C788C5B4C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿;",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 4696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사진을 찍고 있나요?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 4708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC9C4C7440020CC0DACE00020C788B098C694003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0005>Minus를 누르면 사진을 찍을 수 있어요.\n사진에 멋을 더해 주는 기능도 있답니다!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그건 그렇고, 이걸 받아 주세요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 4760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0A0005004D0069006E00750073B97C0020B204B974BA740020C0ACC9C4C7440020CC0DC7440020C2180020C788C5B4C694002E000AC0ACC9C4C5D00020BA4BC7440020B354D5740020C8FCB2940020AE30B2A5B3C40020C788B2F5B2C8B2E4002100100001BE00000AADF8AC740020ADF8B807ACE0002C0020C774AC780020BC1BC5440020C8FCC138C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0005>Minus를 누르면 사진 촬영!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n필터 기능을 사용하거나 음악을 재생해서\n분위기를 바꿀 수 있으니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이것저것 시도해 보세요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 4908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 5068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "레스토랑 풀코스!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 5080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B808C2A4D1A0B7910020D480CF54C2A4002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "레스토랑에서\n포켓몬 승부 풀코스에 도전할 거야!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n무슨 일이든 경험해 보는 게 좋잖아!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 5128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B808C2A4D1A0B791C5D0C11C000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD800020D480CF54C2A4C5D00020B3C4C804D5600020AC70C57C002100100001BE00000ABB34C2A80020C77CC774B4E00020ACBDD5D8D5740020BCF4B2940020AC8C0020C88BC796C54400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "처음 도전할 곳은... 1성급 레스토랑인\n보통 레스토랑으로 해야겠다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 5232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC98C74C0020B3C4C804D5600020ACF3C740002E002E002E00200031C131AE090020B808C2A4D1A0B791C778000ABCF4D1B50020B808C2A4D1A0B791C73CB85C0020D574C57CACA0B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿C",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 5312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "컬러풀한나사!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 5324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEECB7ECD480D55CB098C0AC002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "갑작스럽지만\n미르갈레트를 나눠 주마!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n옆 사람이 파는 미르갈레트는 최고거든!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 5368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC11C791C2A4B7FDC9C0B9CC000ABBF8B974AC08B808D2B8B97C0020B098B2200020C8FCB9C8002100100001BE00000AC6060020C0ACB78CC7740020D30CB2940020BBF8B974AC08B808D2B8B2940020CD5CACE0AC70B4E000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "컬러풀한나사를 모아서\n라시느건설에 가져가 보거라.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n라시느건설은 이 길을 따라\n북쪽으로 조금만 가면 보일 거다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 5460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEECB7ECD480D55CB098C0ACB97C0020BAA8C544C11C000AB77CC2DCB290AC74C124C5D00020AC00C838AC000020BCF4AC70B77C002E00100001BE01000AB77CC2DCB290AC74C124C7400020C7740020AE38C7440020B530B77C000ABD81CABDC73CB85C0020C870AE08B9CC0020AC00BA740020BCF4C77C0020AC70B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿G",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 5592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가스톤을 사야지!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 5604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C2A4D1A4C7440020C0ACC57CC9C0002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기력의조각이 있으면\n기절한 포켓몬도 다시 싸울 수 있어!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n싸울 수 없게 되면\n메가진화도 할 수 없다고.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 5656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B825C758C870AC01C7740020C788C73CBA74000AAE30C808D55C0020D3ECCF13BAACB3C40020B2E4C2DC0020C2F8C6B80020C2180020C788C5B4002100100001BE01000AC2F8C6B80020C2180020C5C6AC8C0020B418BA74000ABA54AC00C9C4D654B3C40020D5600020C2180020C5C6B2E4ACE0002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "프랭탕 애버뉴에 있는\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>스톤숍<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>에서 메가스톤을 살 수 있어!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그렇지만 비싸니까 ZA로열에 참가해서\n돈을 모아 두는 게 좋을 거야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 5780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿K",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 5944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF004B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신의 하트를...!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 5956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C7580020D558D2B8B97C002E002E002E002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모두의 마음을 꽉 사로잡는 기술\n일렉트릭네트 기술머신을 줄게!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 6008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B450C7580020B9C8C74CC7440020AF490020C0ACB85CC7A1B2940020AE30C220000AC77CB809D2B8B9ADB124D2B80020AE30C220BA38C2E0C7440020C904AC8C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "일렉트릭네트는 전기로 된 그물로\n상대를 사로잡아서 공격하는 기술이야.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n사로잡는다는 부분이\n모야모 님을 떠올리게 한단 말이지!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 6080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C77CB809D2B8B9ADB124D2B8B2940020C804AE30B85C0020B41C0020ADF8BB3CB85C000AC0C1B300B97C0020C0ACB85CC7A1C544C11C0020ACF5ACA9D558B2940020AE30C220C774C57C002E00100001BE01000AC0ACB85CC7A1B294B2E4B2940020BD80BD84C774000ABAA8C57CBAA80020B2D8C7440020B5A0C62CB9ACAC8C0020D55CB2E80020B9D0C774C9C000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿O",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 6228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF004F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "곳곳에 있는 방해물들...\n거슬리지 않아?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 6240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACF3ACF3C5D00020C788B2940020BC29D574BB3CB4E4002E002E002E000AAC70C2ACB9ACC9C00020C54AC544003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가결정 같은 걸 부수면\n메가조각을 얻을 수 있는 건 좋지만 말이야.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 6316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00ACB0C8150020AC19C7400020AC780020BD80C218BA74000ABA54AC00C870AC01C7440020C5BBC7440020C2180020C788B2940020AC740020C88BC9C0B9CC0020B9D0C774C57C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바위, 덩굴, 오물은\n특정 기술로만 없앨 수 있으니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이것저것 시도해 보는 게 좋을 거야.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 6396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14C704002C0020B369AD74002C0020C624BB3CC740000AD2B9C8150020AE30C220B85CB9CC0020C5C6C5680020C2180020C788C73CB2C8AE4C00100001BE00000AC774AC83C800AC830020C2DCB3C4D5740020BCF4B2940020AC8C0020C88BC7440020AC70C57C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿S",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 6504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00530000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "패션의 완성은 헤어!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 6516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D328C158C7580020C644C131C7400020D5E4C5B4002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고운 머릿결 같은\n고운깃털을 나눠 줄게!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 6568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0C6B40020BA38B9BFACB00020AC19C740000AACE0C6B4AE43D138C7440020B098B2200020C904AC8C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나는 살롱 드 로주라는 곳을\n눈여겨보고 있어.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n언젠가 헤어스타일이나 머리색을\n멋지게 어레인지할 생각이야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 6616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B2940020C0B4B8710020B4DC0020B85CC8FCB77CB2940020ACF3C744000AB208C5ECACA8BCF4ACE00020C788C5B4002E00100001BE01000AC5B8C820AC000020D5E4C5B4C2A4D0C0C77CC774B0980020BA38B9ACC0C9C744000ABA4BC9C0AC8C0020C5B4B808C778C9C0D5600020C0DDAC01C774C57C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿W",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 6740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00570000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가장 좋아하는 기술...<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 6752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00C7A50020C88BC544D558B2940020AE30C220002E002E002E00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "받아...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 6808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC1BC544002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저주 기술은...\n고스트타입 포켓몬이 사용하면...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n효과가 바뀌어서... 저주를 걸 수 있어...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 6820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C8FC0020AE30C220C740002E002E002E000AACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C0ACC6A9D558BA74002E002E002E00100001BE00000AD6A8ACFCAC000020BC14B00CC5B4C11C002E002E002E0020C800C8FCB97C0020AC780020C2180020C788C5B4002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿[",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 6936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF005B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 지도...\n어느 쪽이 위인 거지...?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 6948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C9C0B3C4002E002E002E000AC5B4B2900020CABDC7740020C704C7780020AC70C9C0002E002E002E003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이쪽인가...? 아니면 이쪽?\n으으... 메가 짜증!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 7024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CABDC778AC00002E002E002E003F0020C544B2C8BA740020C774CABD003F000AC73CC73C002E002E002E0020BA54AC000020C9DCC99D00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메인 메뉴의 옵션에서\n미니맵 회전을 ON으로 할 수 있어.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n나는 회전하는 쪽을 선호하는 편이야.\n어지러워하는 사람도 있는 것 같지만...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 94,
      "offsetInSection": 7084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿_",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 95,
      "offsetInSection": 7244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF005F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "볼 가게!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 96,
      "offsetInSection": 7256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCFC0020AC00AC8C002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "일단 이걸 줄게!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 97,
      "offsetInSection": 7296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C77CB2E80020C774AC780020C904AC8C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저 가게는 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>볼 가게<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>라고 하는데\n희귀한 몬스터볼을 살 수 있어.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 98,
      "offsetInSection": 7316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8000020AC00AC8CB294002000100002FF000006BCFC0020AC00AC8C00100002FF000000B77CACE00020D558B294B370000AD76CADC0D55C0020BAACC2A4D130BCFCC7440020C0B40020C2180020C788C5B4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿c",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 99,
      "offsetInSection": 7404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오늘 밤에도 팍팍 벌어야지!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 100,
      "offsetInSection": 7416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624B2980020BC24C5D0B3C40020D30DD30D0020BC8CC5B4C57CC9C0002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "배틀 존은\n용돈벌이에 아주 제격이야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 101,
      "offsetInSection": 7476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC30D2C00020C874C740000AC6A9B3C8BC8CC774C5D00020C544C8FC0020C81CACA9C774C57C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이기면 이길수록 돈을 버는 구조라\n잘만 하면 하룻밤 만에 엄청 벌 수 있다고!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n포켓몬센터를 이용할 시간이 아까우면\n상처약을 사 두는 것도 방법이야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 102,
      "offsetInSection": 7520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿g",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 103,
      "offsetInSection": 7692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬을\n건강하게 만들어 드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 104,
      "offsetInSection": 7704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC744000AAC74AC15D558AC8C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "일주일 전만 해도 크레이프를 팔고 있었지만\n문득 아이디어가 떠올라서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n지금은 포켓몬센터를 자처하는 중이에요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그럼 바로,\n당신의 포켓몬을 맡아 드리겠습니다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 105,
      "offsetInSection": 7772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너무나도 편리한 출장 포켓몬센터가\n포켓몬을 건강하게 만들어 드리겠습니다!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 106,
      "offsetInSection": 7960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108BB34B098B3C40020D3B8B9ACD55C0020CD9CC7A50020D3ECCF13BAACC13CD130AC00000AD3ECCF13BAACC7440020AC74AC15D558AC8C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맡겨 두신 포켓몬이\n건강해졌습니다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 107,
      "offsetInSection": 8044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9E1ACA80020B450C2E00020D3ECCF13BAACC774000AAC74AC15D574C84CC2B5B2C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬을\n건강하게 만들어 드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 108,
      "offsetInSection": 8084,
